OWN / TIMEOUT):","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":15},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":875725056,"isDeleted":false,"id":"bG0naUoRrhpLiTMC","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":85,"y":1815.0,"strokeColor":"#333333","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":1428.6000000000001,"height":65.0,"seed":493349820,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"qjSMp2vnQV2XyL2W","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":13,"fontFamily":2,"text":"1. [Timeout Inmediato]: El Orchestrator devuelve HTTP 202 ACCEPTED (Pending) al comercio con el order_id.\n2. [Polling Exponencial]: Worker consulta el endpoint /status del proveedor a los 30s, 2m y 10m.\n3. [Reconciliation Batch]: Proceso nocturno compara los extractos de liquidación del procesador contra la base de datos local.\n4. [Resolución]: Si el proveedor cobró -> Transiciona a AUTHORIZED/CAPTURED en Ledger. Si no existe -> Transiciona a DECLINED_TIMEOUT.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"1. [Timeout Inmediato]: El Orchestrator devuelve HTTP 202 ACCEPTED (Pending) al comercio con el order_id.\n2. [Polling Exponencial]: Worker consulta el endpoint /status del proveedor a los 30s, 2m y 10m.\n3. [Reconciliation Batch]: Proceso nocturno compara los extractos de liquidación del procesador contra la base de datos local.\n4. [Resolución]: Si el proveedor cobró -> Transiciona a AUTHORIZED/CAPTURED en Ledger. Si no existe -> Transiciona a DECLINED_TIMEOUT.","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":13},{"type":"frame","version":1,"versionNonce":1571985579,"isDeleted":false,"id":"bA6oNFSN8Vv8z27b","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":0,"y":2360,"strokeColor":"#CBD5E1","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":1645.4,"height":811.0,"seed":2059747898,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"na