nalText":"ASIENTO: Liquidación de Cobro (Capture)\n--------------------------------------------------\nCUENTA DEBITADA (DEBE):\n• Activo / Fondos por Cobrar Pasarela: +$149.50\n\nCUENTAS ACREDITADAS (HABER):\n• Pasivo / Saldo Comercio (Merchant):  +$145.01\n• Ingreso / Comisión Plataforma (Fee):   +$4.49\n\nSUMA DEBE ($149.50) == SUMA HABER ($149.50)\n* Regla Inmutable: Ningún asiento puede modificarse o\n  borrarse. Las correcciones se asientan como Contrapartida.","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":12},{"type":"rectangle","version":1,"versionNonce":2071357258,"isDeleted":false,"id":"5yNiRkvV0so6Lxze","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":1950,"y":3470,"strokeColor":"#F05A5A","backgroundColor":"#FDEFEF","width":900,"height":420,"seed":1293778258,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"WGbLGbnqyOHE8vFG","roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":68638617,"isDeleted":false,"id":"7XZPL8v5bhHTWEAE","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":1975,"y":3490,"strokeColor":"#E03A2F","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":539.0,"height":25.0,"seed":345427083,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"WGbLGbnqyOHE8vFG","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":15,"fontFamily":2,"text":"3. PRINCIPIOS DE AISLAMIENTO Y NO-BLOQUEO:","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"3. PRINCIPIOS DE AISLAMIENTO Y NO-BLOQUEO:","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":15},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":1353572600,"isDeleted":false,"id":"oiGD9gKkjVBJDupH","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":1975,"y":3530,"strokeColor":"#0C0C0C","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":627.8000000000001,"height":227.5,"seed":1235866068,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"WGbLGbnqyOHE8vFG","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":13,"fontFamily":2,"text":"• FUENTE DE VERDAD: El Ledger es la única verdad.\n  Si el Ledger dice que se cobró, el dinero existe.\n\n• NOTIFICACIONES READ-ONLY:\n  El Notification Service jamás muta estados en BD.\n  Si un webhook falla, se reintenta sin tocar saldo.\n\n• ANALYTICS EVENTUAL:\n  El pipeline OLAP es 100% asíncrono. Un fallo en\n  ClickHouse jamás rechaza ni retrasa un pago.\n\n• IDEMPOTENCIA EN CONSUMIDORES:\n  Todos los workers procesan eventos con 'At-Least-Once'.\n  Verifican hash o id de evento antes de ejecutar.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"• FUENTE DE VERDAD: El Ledger es la única verdad.\n  Si el Ledger dice que se cobró, el dinero existe.\n\n• NOTIFICACIONES READ-ONLY:\n  El Notification Service jamás muta estados en BD.\n  Si un webhook falla, se reintenta sin tocar saldo.\n\n• ANALYTICS EVENTUAL:\n  El pipeline OLAP es 100% asíncrono. Un fallo en\n  ClickHouse jamás rechaza ni retrasa un pago.\n\n• IDEMPOTENCIA EN CONSUMIDORES:\n  Todos los workers procesan eventos con 'At-Least-Once'.\n  Verifican hash o id de evento antes de ejecutar.","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":13},{"type":"rectangle","version":1,"versionNonce":1116679182,"isDeleted":false,"id":"1AwZQeKWfNLRur0E","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":50,"y":3920,"strokeColor":"#F5BEC0","backgroundColor":"#F5BEC0","width":2900,"height":50,"seed":649181339,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"WGbLGbnqyOHE8vFG","roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"id":"hEyAhT5tSzY11vXi","type":"text"}],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":291024285,"isDeleted":false,"id":"hEyAhT5tSzY11vXi","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":50,"y":3935.55,"strokeColor":"#0C0C0C","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":2900,"height":18.9000000000